,"shortDescription":{"text":"Modifies, wraps, spoofs, or replaces tools so legitimate-looking calls execute attacker logic"}},{"id":"T08","name":"Insecure Dependencies","shortDescription":{"text":"Introduces malicious packages or components through dependency confusion, typosquatting, or unsafe sources"}},{"id":"T09","name":"Insecure Skill Coding Practices","shortDescription":{"text":"Exposes exploitable flaws such as hardcoded secrets, command injection, plaintext sensitive data, or unsafe temp files"}},{"id":"other","name":"Other Risk","shortDescription":{"text":"Security issues not covered by the T01-T09 classification"}}]}},"results":[],"properties":{"securityScore":100,"primaryLanguage":"Markdown","llm":"gpt-5.6","startTime":1789182209.2626972,"endTime":1789182240.9103298}}]},"skillspector":{"skill":{"name":"multi-search-engine","source":"/tmp/clawhub-codex-scan-v5764qenrnzts56f6q82d0v5ax8e9b7s-Zt57AL/clawscan-skillspector-3402066786/artifact","scanned_at":"2026-09-12T03:03:28.446600+00:00"},"risk_assessment":{"score":55,"severity":"HIGH","recommendation":"DO_NOT_INSTALL","max_issue_severity":"HIGH"},"components":[{"path":"CHANGELOG.md","type":"markdown","lines":15,"executable":false,"size_bytes":376,"source_url":null,"source_identity":null,"source_digest":null},{"path":"CHANNELLOG.md","type":"markdown","lines":48,"executable":false,"size_bytes":1132,"source_url":null,"source_identity":null,"source_digest":null},{"path":"SKILL.md","type":"markdown","lines":110,"executable":false,"size_bytes":3372,"source_url":null,"source_identity":null,"source_digest":null},{"path":"_meta 2.json","type":"json","lines":6,"executable":false,"size_bytes":138,"source_url":null,"source_identity":null,"source_digest":null},{"path":"_meta.json","type":"json","lines":6,"executable":false,"size_bytes":132,"source_url":null,"source_identity":null,"source_digest":null},{"path":"config.json","type":"json","lines":22,"executable":false,"size_bytes":1701,"source_url":null,"source_identity":null,"source_digest":null},{"path":"metadata.json","type":"json","lines":7,"executable":false,"size_bytes":239,"source_url":null,"source_identity":null,"source_digest":null},{"path":"references/international-search.md","type":"markdown","lines":651,"executable":false,"size_bytes":23161,"source_url":null,"source_identity":null,"source_digest":null}],"structured_summaries":[],"issues":[{"id":"AE1","finding_id":"finding-67855e3ad65f4e038fb7ac75284df521","category":"analysis-evasion","pattern":null,"severity":"HIGH","confidence":1,"location":{"file":"SKILL.md","start_line":105,"end_line":null},"finding":"references/international-search.md (partial)","explanation":"Referenced artifact was not completely inspected","remediation":"Make the referenced artifact locally available and fully analyzable, or remove the reference.","code_snippet":"- `references/international-search.md` - International search guide","intent":null,"tags":["coverage","reference","target-disposition:partial"],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":"1f5acb515b8b013faa7cf84eceac36c79645ba9e78413a09709cdacff4a26a11","occurrences":[{"file":"SKILL.md","start_line":105,"end_line":null}]},{"id":"SQP-3","finding_id":"finding-06cf07cabc0347fe8141004139e7f623","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.88,"location":{"file":"CHANNELLOG.md","start_line":3,"end_line":45},"finding":null,"explanation":"The file presents its operational description, feature list, and usage examples entirely in Chinese, which can impose a language constraint on users without opt-in. Under the policy, forcing a specific language without offering a choice or documenting a justified regional limitation is a natural-language policy concern.","remediation":"Provide an English version or bilingual documentation, or explicitly state that the skill is intended for a Chinese-speaking or region-specific audience and why that limitation is necessary.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":["llm-unconfirmed"],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"CHANNELLOG.md","start_line":3,"end_line":45}]},{"id":"SQP-2","finding_id":"finding-a035440d7567488ab24bcb4a85a0adb1","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.95,"location":{"file":"SKILL.md","start_line":8,"end_line":55},"finding":null,"explanation":"The skill routes user-provided queries directly to third-party search engines, but it does not warn users that their search terms may be transmitted to external services with different logging, tracking, and jurisdictional privacy practices. This is especially relevant because the skill emphasizes privacy engines and broad multi-engine support, which may lead users to assume privacy characteristics that do not apply uniformly across all providers.","remediation":"Add a clear privacy and data-sharing warning in the skill description and usage docs stating that queries are sent to external search providers and may be logged or tracked by those services. Also identify which engines are privacy-focused versus standard engines, advise users not to submit sensitive data, and preferably require explicit user confirmation before sending potentially sensitive queries.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"SKILL.md","start_line":8,"end_line":55}]},{"id":"SQP-3","finding_id":"finding-d57f3391f29248798c85255d7f638827","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.84,"location":{"file":"config.json","start_line":4,"end_line":10},"finding":null,"explanation":"The config explicitly labels multiple engines as region \"cn\" and includes China-specific endpoints such as Baidu and Bing CN, but there is no natural-language indication that users can choose or opt into this locale-specific behavior. Under the policy, forcing a specific locale without user choice can be a natural-language policy concern even in config values.","remediation":"Document the locale behavior and provide an explicit user-facing choice of region/search locale, or add configuration that defaults neutrally and requires opt-in before using China-specific engines.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":["llm-unconfirmed"],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"config.json","start_line":4,"end_line":10}]},{"id":"SQP-2","finding_id":"finding-3b4dbf3a3c584ba98d780b26c0e8dad2","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.95,"location":{"file":"references/international-search.md","start_line":63,"end_line":93},"finding":null,"explanation":"The document provides direct `web_fetch` examples to third-party search engines without warning that user queries will be sent to external providers, potentially logged, profiled, or associated with IP and browser metadata. In a search-integration skill, this is contextually relevant behavior, but omitting privacy disclosure can still mislead users into transmitting sensitive terms to external services unintentionally.","remediation":"Add a clear warning before the examples stating that queries are transmitted to external search providers and may be logged or correlated with user metadata. Recommend avoiding sensitive personal, credential, medical, legal, or proprietary queries, and prefer privacy-preserving engines or anonymizing options when appropriate.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"references/international-search.md","start_line":63,"end_line":93}]},{"id":"SQP-2","finding_id":"finding-3d2ccbe5985f4ac0bf49f7dfa3cacde6","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"MEDIUM","confidence":0.95,"location":{"file":"references/international-search.md","start_line":163,"end_line":165},"finding":null,"explanation":"The guide explicitly documents parameters for disabling safe search (`kp=-1`, `nj=0`) without any caution about exposure to adult, harmful, or workplace-inappropriate content. In an agent skill, users may copy these examples directly, increasing the chance of unsafe content retrieval or policy violations in downstream use.","remediation":"Add warnings next to unsafe filter-disabling examples explaining the content-safety and compliance risks. Default all examples to safe-search-enabled settings, and move filter-disabling options into an advanced section with explicit justification and age/policy suitability guidance.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":[],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"references/international-search.md","start_line":163,"end_line":165}]},{"id":"SQP-3","finding_id":"finding-55fe57d29337407f8cd4d9a7548bfd14","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"LOW","confidence":0.77,"location":{"file":"references/international-search.md","start_line":1,"end_line":651},"finding":null,"explanation":"Natural-language content throughout the file is exclusively Chinese, and several examples prescribe specific locale settings such as `hl=en`, `lr=lang_zh-CN`, `cr=countryCN`, `kl=cn`, and `language=english`. For a general search guide, this can amount to a language or locale constraint without explicit user opt-in or a documented reason that the skill is region-specific.","remediation":"State clearly that the guide is intended for Chinese-speaking users or add a note that language/region parameters are optional examples and should be selected based on user preference and locale needs.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":["llm-unconfirmed"],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"references/international-search.md","start_line":1,"end_line":651}]}],"suppressed_count":0,"suppressed":[],"metadata":{"has_executable_scripts":false,"skillspector_version":"2.11.2","llm_requested":true,"llm_available":true,"meta_analysis_applied":true,"inference_usage":[{"node":"semantic_developer_intent","request_kind":"structured_output","provider":"openai","model":"gpt-5.4-2026-03-05","model_source":"provider_response","usage_source